WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — ai-reads-human (ig) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.276
<v Narrator>N'oge mbụ, kọmputa na-atụgharị data n'ime usoro iheomume edere maka anya mmadụ, na-egbochi igwe iji rụọ ọrụ ọzọ.

2
00:00:09.356 --> 00:00:18.512
<v Narrator>Nke abụọ, ịgụ ntinye ntọala ngwe na-ewe ihe karịrị ugboro abụọ puku karịa chip ike karịa ịgụ compact igwe nọmba.

3
00:00:18.592 --> 00:00:28.490
<v Narrator>Nke atọ, ịkpụzi ngwe nke ejiri aka mee ihe n'ime okwu AI na-ekpo ọkụ ugboro iri abụọ karịa ike karịa ka ọ dị na ngwe ahụ.
